                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-950 border border-emerald-300 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block w-max mb-2">一类常态优势区</span>
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1.5">常态化健壮管护 (Maintenance)</h4>
